{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RecallNote 是一款結合筆記、記憶卡與複習功能的學習工具，適合準備認證考試、公務員考試、學校測驗、語言學習及詞彙背誦的人士。它依遺忘曲線安排間隔重複，協助使用者在忘記前及時回顧，並可配合 PDF 加入手寫或打字筆記。原價 US $12.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>遺忘曲線智能複習與考前衝刺</h2>\n<p>RecallNote 依遺忘曲線安排間隔重複，在忘記前及時回顧，並追蹤記憶保留率與複習次數。可用打字或手寫建立複習卡，無須輸入科目或標題便可快速儲存；考前模式方便在考試前重溫重點，並可與朋友分享考前卡。配合 PDF 學習時可加入手寫或打字筆記，擷取後即建立複習卡與考前卡，另設複習通知及 iPhone、iPad、Mac 同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-94-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-95-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-96-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RecallNote</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T22:58:26.708400+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}